# How slide-engine was built

Retrospective synthesis of the recorded requests, repository changes, and verification evidence. Source coordinates refer to the imported session JSONL.

## MDX becomes a native Unreal presentation

The original request was to author slides in MDX, embed custom models and animations, build a game, and fly between slides with an editable layout. The implemented separation is build-time MDX compilation in Node and native rendering in Unreal. The git-meta README supplied the original example content. The first three checkpoints have terse messages, so the opening conversation is essential context.

