## The slide layout becomes a themed park

The user replaced a generic arrangement with a Jurassic Park island, then repeatedly simplified and reshaped its coastline, paths, facilities, fences, and paddocks using screenshots. Blender sources and import scripts make the art reproducible. Cards became numbered destinations with authored subject-facing camera paths, hidden content during travel, and an arrival reveal. Dinosaurs, a hidden beach stop, and monitoring jokes established the presentation setting.

