## Physical hardware and the SGI desktop

A modeled CRT, keyboard, tower, and mouse became the Computer component. The login/logout desktop and park controls became a persistent presentation shell. Computer demonstrations use foreground hardware; CommandLine demonstrations minimize park control and use a desktop terminal. These are distinct presentation modes requested by the user, rather than one generic slide renderer.

