## Numbered MDX sequences replace single pages

Station directories became ordered sequences of Markdown and native component steps. The user first asked to retain all group content; later requested full-width replacement of Markdown instead of horizontal stacking. Native demonstrations retain appropriate background context. Arrow navigation, reverse navigation, reset, progress meters, and time controls are covered by the associated runtime checks.

