## Offline recorded commands and fresh content

CommandLine changed from authored prompt/output strings to local asciicast playback with ANSI handling. The user required casts from ./casts and reported that npm start kept showing an old recording. The launch pipeline was changed to compile and stage fresh content; space controls playback. No shell command is executed as part of the recorded demonstration.

