## Themed native components and the final route

FSV provides the filesystem metaphor, ColdStorage reveals authored specimens, and Raptors uses warning signs and incident clipboards. Title-only pages become physical signs. The user reordered the route to open at the Research Center with an employee badge, moved the gate introduction to station four, retained the hidden eighth stop, and ended at a Questions desktop. These revisions are preserved as decisions rather than presenting the final route as the original design.

