## Explain metadata storage through a desktop visualizer

Serializer connects metadata values in a SQLite view to Git blobs, trees, and commits in an object explorer. Follow-up requests refined the two-commit sequence, selection detail, labels, and layout. This demonstrates the metadata representation with explicit state transitions; the compiler and tests define the supported authored input.

