## Metadata introduction and browser-screen finishing

The metadata explanation was inserted between the badge and ColdStorage. Its nested bullets required compiler and Slate indentation support. The station-four text introduction was replaced with the user-supplied website screenshot, embedded for offline use and framed as a browser on the existing Computer model. The last landing included earlier exchange refinements and authored slide edits, not only work produced during this finishing session.

