## How to interpret this archive

Session links describe evidence, not blanket authorship. Multiple sessions can contribute to one commit, and a finishing session may commit work from an earlier session. Branch names are historical labels; GitButler change IDs are retained when available. Early checkpoint commits and imported conversations have weaker provenance and are listed in the coverage report.

The archive preserves ordinary messages, tool calls and outputs, and embedded images. Internal reasoning, system/developer instructions, runtime bookkeeping, and repeated compaction mirrors are excluded. Recorded failures remain visible. Source hashes identify the captured prefixes of the original logs; they are not hashes of the normalized exports.
